    </question>
    <question no="18" id="PRB-C9D862B55F549B49-Q18" type="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형">
      <stem>메시지 신호는 $m ( t ) = 2 \cos ( 2 \pi f_{m} t )$이고, 양측파대 반송파억압(DSB-SC) 방식을 이용하여 변조할 때, 상측파대 신호의 스펙트럼은? (단, 반송파는 $\cos ( 2 \pi f_{c} t )$이고, $f_{c} &gt; &gt; f_{m}$이다)</stem>
      <formulas count="7">
        <formula area="질문">m ( t ) = 2 \cos ( 2 \pi f_{m} t )</formula>
        <formula area="질문">\cos ( 2 \pi f_{c} t )</formula>
        <formula area="질문">f_{c} &gt; &gt; f_{m}</formula>
        <formula area="선택지①">\frac{1}{2} [ \delta ( f - f_{c} - f_{m} ) + \delta ( f + f_{c} + f_{m} ) ]</formula>
        <formula area="선택지②">\frac{1}{2} [ \delta ( f - f_{c} + f_{m} ) + \delta ( f + f_{c} - f_{m} ) ]</formula>
        <formula area="선택지③">\frac{1}{2} [ \delta ( f + f_{c} + f_{m} ) + \delta ( f + f_{c} - f_{m} ) ]</formula>
        <formula area="선택지④">\frac{1}{2} [ \delta ( f - f_{c} - f_{m} ) + \delta ( f + f_{c} - f_{m} ) ]</formula>
      </formulas>
      <choices count="4">
        <choice no="1" is_answer="true">$\frac{1}{2} [ \delta ( f - f_{c} - f_{m} ) + \delta ( f + f_{c} + f_{m} ) ]$</choice>
        <choice no="2" is_answer="false">$\frac{1}{2} [ \delta ( f - f_{c} + f_{m} ) + \delta ( f + f_{c} - f_{m} ) ]$</choice>
        <choice no="3" is_answer="false">$\frac{1}{2} [ \delta ( f + f_{c} + f_{m} ) + \delta ( f + f_{c} - f_{m} ) ]$</choice>
        <choice no="4" is_answer="false">$\frac{1}{2} [ \delta ( f - f_{c} - f_{m} ) + \delta ( f + f_{c} - f_{m} ) ]$</choice>
      </choices>
      <answer source="정답표" cross_check="">1</answer>
      <explanation_ref file="통신이론_해설.xml" question_no="18">정답 ① · 핵심 개념·이론 이해형 (m ( t ), 양측파대 반송파억압(DSB-SC))</explanation_ref>
    </question>
    <question no="19" id="PRB-C9D862B55F549B49-Q19" type="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형">
      <stem>입력 신호가 $x ( t )$이고 출력 신호가 $y ( t )$일 때, 입출력 관계가 $y ( t ) = \int_{0}^{t + 1} {x ( \tau )} d \tau$인 시스템에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것은?</stem>
      <formulas count="3">
        <formula area="질문">x ( t )</formula>
        <formula area="질문">y ( t )</formula>
        <formula area="질문">y ( t ) = \int_{0}^{t + 1} {x ( \tau )} d \tau</formula>
      </formulas>
      <choices count="4">
        <choice no="1" is_answer="true">선형(linear) 시스템이다.</choice>
        <choice no="2" is_answer="false">시불변(time-invariant) 시스템이다.</choice>
        <choice no="3" is_answer="false">인과(causal) 시스템이다.</choice>
        <choice no="4" is_answer="false">무기억(memoryless) 시스템이다.</choice>
      </choices>
      <answer source="정답표" cross_check="">1</answer>
      <explanation_ref file="통신이론_해설.xml" question_no="19">정답 ① · 핵심 개념·이론 이해형 (x ( t ), y ( t ), 선형(linear), 시불변(time-invariant), 인과(causal))</explanation_ref>
    </question>
